,"merged_at":"2025-05-07T17:54:39Z"},"body":"- related #88452\r\n\r\nCertain tests fail when by themselves, since they depend on other tests.\r\nUse these args to test:\r\n`--test --tc=\"[ProjectSettings]*\"`, `--test --tc=\"[Modules][GDScript] Load source code dynamically and run it\"`\r\n\r\nI tested on release build and this seems to fix the issues from #88452 for these 3 tests, the other one still has an issue in non-editor builds.\r\n\r\nFor `[ProjectSettings] Get existing setting` and `[ProjectSettings] Default value is ignored if setting exists`, they expect to be ran after the `[Modules][GDScript]` `Script compilation and runtime` test, which modifies the ProjectSettings.\r\nI changed them to use a different project setting that was untouched by that test.\r\n\r\nFor `[Modules][GDScript] Load source code dynamically and run it`, the GDScript fails during compilation with an error `Compile Error: GDScript bug (please report): Native class \"RefCounted\" not found.`.\r\nThis is because the language wasn't initialized for this test.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions"